# GLM-5.2 scheduler-free internal decode benchmark

## Task
Implement and run a configurable SGLang internal-forward benchmark: concurrency 16, ISL 70000, OSL 10000, expected accept length 3.61 (including bonus). Execute real draft/verify/draft-extension; do not instantiate Scheduler, serving endpoints or PD workers. Produce reproducible performance evidence.

## Background
Approved design is in design.md. SIKL's profile_decode.py is a fixed-context non-MTP reference, not a complete solution. Real model weights and routing; physically populated synthetic prefix KV/index state; simulated acceptance is not correctness-valid generation.

